            </map>
            <map to='#8c5b43'>
              <bucket>&quot;(FREY) Dr. Paetow seized the collection on 20 October 1942 and it is only on 2 February 1943 that Mr. Fleischer, Bruno Lohse’s aide, had the collection processed at the Jeu de Paume.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
