            <map to='#a65e3f'>
              <bucket>&quot;(DFS) Dreyfuss (SD-Quartier)&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
            <map to='#a65e3f'>
              <bucket>&quot;(ERL) Erlanger (Brissac/Paris)--The official losses sutained by Philippe Erlanger were connected with the seizure of crates at Brissac containing paintings and antiquities. Other collections were stored there under the protection of the Duke of Brissac. Mr. Erlanger&apos;s Paris apartment was raided in October and Decemberl of 1942.&quot;</bucket>
            </map>
